# the effects grid: REC held shows it, the white keys play the effects while held; a tap on REC stays dub hold
# (on Stratosfear: no Emerge, both sequences from the first bar)
wait 300
turn PRESET 4
wait 300
expect piece 4
listen
wait 3000
press REC
wait 400
said EFFECTS GRID
key w4 down
wait 300
said Low-pass
key w12 down
wait 1500
release REC
wait 300
key w4 up
key w12 up
wait 800
expect frozen 0
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 1
said HOLD ON
tap REC
wait 300
expect frozen 0
# every effect in turn, and all of them at once: no clipping
